Major part of this was that we still had 2 domain controllers running
2000.  After installing only the NFS Authentication service package from
Microsoft Windows Services for Unix, that took care of most of my
problem.  I still have some issues, such as some Unix accounts are able
to write to the directory, but cannot delete what they've written there.
I'll keep working on it...=20

